## PART 3: GRAND FEATURE ADDITIONS

These features are **contextually relevant** to your application and would significantly elevate it:

### 🔴 High Priority (Missing Core Features)
| # | Feature | Why It's Critical |
|---|---------|------------------|
| 1 | **AI Sponsor-Event Matching** | You have the roadmap entry but zero implementation. Matching based on niche, geo, budget, audience_size is your biggest differentiator. |
| 2 | **Deal Amount Negotiation UI** | Currently deal has `payment_amount` but there's **no API endpoint to set it before payment**. Users cannot specify deal value at creation time. |
| 3 | **Email Notification on Deal Actions** | KYC sends nothing. Signing sends nothing. Only in-app notifications exist. Email is mandatory for trust. |
| 4 | **Onboarding Checklist Flow** | You have `LifecycleNudge` model but no guided first-time-user flow showing "Create your first event → invite a sponsor → propose a deal." |
| 5 | **Admin Dashboard Panel** | Your code checks for `role == "admin"` everywhere (KYC review, trust management) but there's **no admin user creation flow and no admin frontend page**. |

### 🟡 Medium Priority (Differentiators)
| # | Feature | Why It Adds Value |
|---|---------|------------------|
| 6 | **Public Sponsor/Event Discovery Feed** | A search page where sponsors can find events and organizers can discover brands — the core of a marketplace. |
| 7 | **Digital Contract PDF Export** | Generate a signed contract PDF at deal close (with signature text, amounts, parties). Huge trust signal. |
| 8 | **Influencer Media Kit** | Auto-generate a shareable profile card (audience size, platforms, niche, past deals, trust score) that influencers can share with sponsors. |
| 9 | **In-app Deal Chat with File Attachments** | Current chat is text-only. Allowing sponsors to send contract drafts/media briefs in chat is critical. |
| 10 | **Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** | Important for a financial platform handling deals and payments. |

### 🟢 Expansion Features (Future)
| # | Feature |
|---|---------|
| 11 | Mobile PWA with push notifications |
| 12 | Real HubSpot OAuth integration (currently simulated) |
| 13 | Multi-currency support (currently only INR) |
| 14 | Sponsor ROI analytics (reach, engagement metrics linked to deal) |
| 15 | Automated tax invoice generation (GST-compliant) for Indian market |

