Fix these 5 things first — they are blockers for any real user:

1. **BUG-001** — Set `payment_amount` on deal creation
2. **BUG-007/008/009** — Remove IDOR fields from Campaign/Event/Review create schemas
3. **BUG-010** — Block reviews on non-closed deals
4. **BUG-013** — Enforce billing plan limits in routers
5. **BUG-019** — Add password strength check to reset endpoint
